na&_nc_gid=FvLT9EF8J28wDQaJwsAUPg&_nc_ss=7320f&oh=00_AQSoV9-m1vDbSAqkcEuchYQum3fs0HgwdweRfZpPlF6CzA&oe=6AEDB77F", "author": "thaotamto", "followers": 589932, "music": "Original audio \u00b7 thaotamto", "musicOriginal": true, "hashtags": [], "ratio": 11.19, "medianViews": 48744, "outlier": 135.46, "medianN": 5, "baselineFrom": "2026-10-10", "baselineTo": "2026-10-29", "medianFetchedAt": 1793579375472, "denominator": "median"}, {"id": "3967092331747788579", "text": "Crispy tofu without the oil splatter? \ud83d\udc40\n\nThis is one of my favourite ways to pan-fry tofu until it\u2019s beautifully golden and crispy, with all those little crunchy edges.\n\nThe trick is simple: gently smash the tofu to create more surface area, add a spoonful of flour (plain flour, corstarch, rice flour) to the hot oil, and then\u2026 leave the tofu alone.\n\nDon\u2019t flip it too early! Let the bottom turn properly golden and crispy first, then flip. This helps prevent the tofu from sticking to the pan and gives it that delicious crispy texture.\n\nServe it with a sweet and sour dipping sauce, or use it in one of my favourite Vietnamese noodle dishes: crispy tofu, rice noodles and a savoury soy sauce dressing. \ud83e\udd24\n\nAnd if you\u2019d like to explore more Vietnamese vegan recipes, you\u2019ll find plenty more in my cookbook. \u2764\ufe0f\n\n#erinphamvn2uk #crispytofu #friedtofu #panfriedtofu #tofurecipe", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcN8XUJAMcj/", "createTime": "2026-08-19T10:13:37.000Z", "plays": 5952997, "likes": 193277, "comments": 1282, "shares": 66174, "saves": null, "duration": 86.466667, "cover": "https://instagram.fadl5-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.71878-15/777948272_1673089227112004_7842114281893169576_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=Mzk2NzA5MjMzMTc0Nzc4ODU3OQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZmlyc3RfZnJhbWVfdGh1bWJuYWlsLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=ZDiz9l8JgxgQ7kNvwEty_c