ratio": 5.07, "medianViews": 35102.0, "outlier": 42.49, "medianN": 6, "baselineFrom": "2026-10-12", "baselineTo": "2026-10-30", "medianFetchedAt": 1793579375472, "denominator": "median"}, {"id": "4015077580985586337", "text": "Kommentiere \u201cTofu\u201d und ich schicke dir das Rezept per DM zu \ud83e\udef6\n\nKorean Glazed Popcorn Tofu mit 110g Protein \ud83e\udd24\n\nKnusprig, klebrig und richtig w\u00fcrzig, perfekt f\u00fcr Reis oder auch einfach so \ud83d\ude0a\n\n\ud83d\udcca N\u00e4hrwerte (Gesamtrezept):\n\ud83d\udcaa 109g Protein\n\ud83e\udd54 115g Kohlenhydrate\n\ud83e\uded2 52g Fett\n\nDie komplette Zutatenliste, alle Mengenangaben und die Schritt-f\u00fcr-Schritt-Anleitung findest du kostenlos auf meinem Blog \ud83e\udef6\n\n\ud83d\udc49 Den Link findest du in meiner Bio.\n\nAll recipes are also available in English on my blog \ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7\n\nIch poste regelm\u00e4\u00dfig \u00e4hnliche vegane high protein Rezepte, also folge meinem Kanal @vegan_high_protein um nichts zu verpassen \ud83e\udef6\n\n#veganhighprotein #proteinreich #vegandeutschland #veganerezepte #tofu", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/De4a8mAR9Kh/", "createTime": "2026-10-24T15:11:21.000Z", "plays": 656288, "likes": 7222, "comments": 2716, "shares": 2529, "saves": null, "duration": 19.666666, "cover": "https://scontent-ssn1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/863353194_1025400227254588_3502056925777122115_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ig_cache_key=NDAxNTA3NzU4MDk4NTU4NjMzNzIyMjgxNjU0MTc3NDU1ODA%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fdXNlcl9zZWxlY3RlZF90aHVtYm5haWwuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=tBGSOmm57qkQ7kNvwEwrwBw&_nc_oc=AdqnvVdgP_YV_LYWWU1OPsxVA4hhoXXlJ1-QCFPXYLfIX24ZaleLxX-kxdKWiZMo0fk&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-ssn1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=GZSsPbSpwSSSYNatYTBtYw&_nc_ss=7320f&oh=00_AQQQy-z-frsBT5j61PEzbDvnIBSgxCT7_NxzOI924V41kA&oe=6AEDA7F0", "author": "vegan_high_protein", "followers": 508668, "music": "", "musicOriginal": false, "hashtags": ["veganhighprotein", "proteinreich", "vegandeutschland", "veganerezepte", "tofu"], "ratio": 1.29, "medianViews": 33349.0, "outlier": 19.68, "medianN": 6, "baselineFrom": "2026-10-25", "baselineTo": "2026-11-01", "medianFetchedAt": 1793579375472, "denominator": "median"}, {"id": "3989438398069123761", "text": "Felt vegan, might delete later \ud83d\ude0c \n\nCrispy Soy Sesame Tofu \ud83c\udf62\nIngredients\n\nFor the tofu:\n\u2022 250g extra-firm tofu, pressed and cubed\n\u2022 1 tbsp cornstarch\n\u2022 1 tsp oil\n\nFor the sauce:\n\u2022 2 tbsp soy sauce\n\u2022 1 tbsp hot sriracha\n\u2022 1 tbsp honey\n\u2022 1 tbsp rice vinegar\n\u2022 1 tsp toasted sesame oil\n\u2022 2 garlic cloves, minced\n\u2022 1 tsp cornstarch mixed with 2 tbsp water\n\u2022 1 tsp sesame seeds\n\u2022 Spring onions\n\u2022 Extra sesame seeds\n\nMethod:\n\n1. Toss the tofu cubes with cornstarch until evenly coated. Spray with oil and air-fry at 200\u00b0C for 15\u201318 minutes, shaking halfway, until golden and crispy.\n2. Add the soy sauce, sriracha, honey, rice vinegar, sesame oil and garlic to a pan. Simmer for 1 minute.\n3. Stir in the cornstarch slurry and cook until the sauce becomes thick and glossy.\n4. Add the crispy tofu and toss until evenly coated. Mix in the sesame seeds.\n5. Finish with spring onions and extra sesame seeds.\n\nSave this for your next meat-free meal \u2728\n\n#tofu #protein #comfortfood #easyrecipes #explore", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DddVRYKNqqx/", "createTime": "2026-09-19T06:10:18.000Z", "plays": 343086, "likes": 7218, "comments": 34, "shares": 2941, "saves": null, "duration": 17.266666, "cover": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/817456027_18062346935787496_394669864783626653_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=106&ig_cache_key=Mzk4OTQzODM5ODA2OTEyMzc2MTE4MDYyMzQ2OTMyNzg3NDk2.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fdXNlcl9zZWxl