 1793579375472, "denominator": "median"}, {"id": "3972350465685289944", "text": "Why I used to hate tofu:\n- I would buy the wrong type \n- I never pressed it\n- I would just pour some random store-bought sauce on it and call it a day\n\nBUT NOW\u2026 I make some of the best tofu recipes in my life. Comment RECIPE to try my Mongolian Tofu Stir Fry!\n\nWhy I love tofu now:\n- I use extra firm or super firm almost excessively\n- I press it using my tofu press (unless its super firm, then you don\u2019t have to)\n- I make the BEST sauces..like this Mongolian sauce!\n\nRECIPE URL: https://naturallieplantbased.com/mongolian-tofu-stir-fry/\n\nFollow along for more plant-based recipes ideas!\n\n#plantbased #healthyrecipes", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dcgn7O-h3vY/", "createTime": "2026-08-26T16:18:58.000Z", "plays": 127280, "likes": 649, "comments": 87, "shares": 72, "saves": null, "duration": 19.24789, "cover": "https://scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/786344108_18080502647687629_5934838931480447077_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=108&ig_cache_key=Mzk3MjM1MDQ2NTY4NTI4OTk0NDE4MDgwNTAyNjQxNjg3NjI5.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjg2NC5zZHIudmlkZW9fdXNlcl91cGxvYWRlZF90aHVtYm5haWwuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=WgeAB5NzuFwQ7kNvwEVcJ3E&_nc_oc=AdosKIpJMQlH9_V0dAfS_gm87ZMdRrfGV87Xb1MIAJTqNZ7tbUJfuNlmPMmXYU7F-rMZn9Lo7Vs435nlZXnlkLxe&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=VTPL2FipXC8s5ySVrO3C-g&_nc_ss=7320f&oh=00_AQQJ11fxaFCiZCjzrTtp1tQto3eMPunJjuOWhsTlJAdkxg&oe=6AEDBC5C", "author": "naturallieplantbased", "followers": 372838, "music": "Original audio \u00b7 naturallieplantbased", "musicOriginal": true, "hashtags": ["plantbased", "healthyrecipes"], "ratio": 0.34, "medianViews": 29548.5, "outlier": 4.31, "medianN": 6, "baselineFrom": "2026-10-21", "baselineTo": "2026-11-01", "medianFetchedAt": 1793579375472, "denominator": "median"}, {"id": "4019712954486887122", "text": "comment \u201cPUMPKIN\u201d to have this free recipe sent to your inbox - PUMPKIN-GOCHUJANG TOFU \ud83c\udf83\ud83c\udf36\ufe0f \n\n#veganrecipes #pumpkin #plantbased", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfI46J_OhLS/", "createTime": "2026-10-31T00:41:37.000Z", "plays": 109281, "likes": 3112, "comments": 785, "shares": 1065, "saves": null, "duration": 28.768072, "cover": "https://scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/870580399_18135390613739323_4200230038856133423_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ig_cache_key=NDAxOTcxMjk1NDQ4Njg4NzEyMjE4MTM1MzkwNjA3NzM5MzIz.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fdXNlcl9zZWxlY3RlZF90aHVtYm5haWwuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=z8P_XFJf9xIQ7kNvwG4lCoQ&_nc_oc=Adqpg1gjleTtUBISmFWWeKdn2vObHkRBf0GqfMdwWQBeIXerRqeXPjcVnDFm-moTpFA&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=-CbtwhuP5pazEmUjFL2YnQ&_nc_ss=7320f&oh=00_AQQ26RrmnPRcFZ0Id7RjUydVD71hpmwvpiM01zB8_2g08A&oe=6AEDBA76", "author": "vegscratchkitchen", "followers": 589846, "music": "Original audio \u00b7 vegscratchkitchen", "musicOriginal": true, "hashtags": ["veganrecipes", "pumpkin", "plantbased"], "ratio": 0.19, "medianViews": 109421.5, "outlier": 1.0, "medianN": 6, "baselineFrom": "2026-10-16", "baselineTo": "2026-11-01", "medianFetchedAt": 1793579375472, "denominator": "median"}, {"id": "4017428646242838414", "text": "If you still think tofu is boring, this Bang Bang Tofu might just change your mind! \ud83c\udf31\n\nI love how crispy the tofu gets in the oven, and using half mayo and half yogurt makes the sauce a little lighter without sacrificing flavor.\n\nTear 1 package (14\u201316 oz) of vacuum-sealed super-firm tofu into bite-sized pieces. Toss with 2 tbsp tamari and 1\u00bd tbsp oil, then add 2 tbsp cornstarch and \u00be tsp garlic powder. Bake at 425\u00b0F for 20\u201325 minutes until crispy, flipping halfway through.\n\nFor the Bang Bang sauce, mix 2 tbsp vegan mayo, 2 tbsp thick vegan yogurt, 3 tbsp sweet chili sauce, 1 tbsp sriracha, 1 tsp white miso paste and 1 tsp tamari. Toss with the crispy tofu and finish with chopped chives and sesame seeds.\n\nI\u2019ll also be sharing this one on my Substack later this week! \ud83e\udd0d\n\n#tofurecipes #bangbangtofu #highproteinvegan #crispytofu #easyrecipe", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfAxhGJyGeO/", "createTime": "2026-10-27T21:02:03.000Z", "plays": 88930, "likes": 1699, "comments": 14, "shares": 691, "saves": null, "duration": 25.14576, "cover": "https://instagram.fcps4-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.71878-15/867337924_2706779616425312_5559473266371852745_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=105&ig_cache_key=NDAxNzQyODY0NjI0MjgzODQxNDMxNTA2NDcyOTg0NzM1Mzk%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fdXNlcl9zZWxlY3RlZF90aHVtYm5haWwuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=9G9RWbzEnCwQ7kNvwHamWMk&_nc_oc=AdoQfVIMB6IIAhVy746R-PdHUjmMcChHwC96XlinE2MM_sL0rdCq1kIuKTOyrrQW-lokCSnqRdm4N4yHHFlIkKWO&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fcps4-2.fna&_nc_gid=GAsjntNvkPn-1iuARdoGeA&_nc_ss=7320f&oh=00_AQSyyN5NRN8h80ezYcJjv2N2fPgLm0RG8yn9yuhGeGE1dQ&oe=6AEDABB0", "author": "girlmeetsvegan", "followers": 15638, "music": "Bang Bang \u00b7 Jessie J, Ariana Grande, Nicki Minaj", "musicOriginal": false, "hashtags": ["tofurecipes", "bangbangtofu", "highproteinvegan", "crispytofu", "easyrecipe"], "ratio": 5.69, "medianViews": 2517, "outlier": 35.33, "medianN": 5, "baselineFrom": "2026-10-10", "baselineTo": "2026-10-27", "medianFetchedAt": 1793579375472, "denominator": "median"}], "mediansPending": false}